{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "18", "m": "10", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "01", "M": "55", "S": "30"}}, "news": [{"title": "DHBVN directs ATS Triumph's developer to separate power, upkeep charges", "para": "Dakshin Haryana Bijli Vitran Nigam has ordered ATS Triumph to create a unified billing format for residents. This directive comes after the Haryana Electricity Regulatory Commission identified issues with billing methods and infrastructure. The developer is expected to delineate maintenance and diesel generator fees in bills to safeguard against disconnections. Compliance deadlines have been established to foster transparency and address customer concerns more efficiently.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/regulatory/dhbvn-directs-ats-triumphs-developer-to-separate-power-upkeep-charges/135014051?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-96854/135014051.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "regulatory"}, {"title": "Building around heritage, not over it: A new approach to urban development in India\u2019s historic cities", "para": "Historic cities stand at a crossroads where preservation meets modern progress, requiring thoughtful integration of contemporary architecture alongside traditional landscapes. Ensuring sustainability and honoring local customs can significantly improve urban life. Developers are encouraged to assess how new structures will affect neighboring communities and shared spaces, fostering an environment where a robust economy flourishes in harmony with cultural heritage.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/blog/building-around-heritage-not-over-it-a-new-approach-to-urban-development-in-indias-historic-cities/135013104?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-188328/135013104.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "building-around-heritage-not-over-it-a-new-approach-to-urban-development-in-indias-historic-cities"}, {"title": "Protected tenancy in Telangana: Why due diligence must go beyond sale deeds & encumbrance searches", "para": "The land tenure system in Telangana has deep roots in historical land distribution inequities and laws enacted after Independence. The Telangana Tenancy and Agricultural Lands Act of 1950 establishes tenant rights, which can complicate current ownership claims. Protected tenants hold significant rights, including the right of first offer for purchase.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/blog/protected-tenancy-in-telangana-why-due-diligence-must-go-beyond-sale-deeds-encumbrance-searches/135012978?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-122530/135012978.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "protected-tenancy-in-telangana-why-due-diligence-must-go-beyond-sale-deeds-encumbrance-searches"}]}